 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 4.08,
   "end": 7.405,
   "text": "Optimization usually lives in flat space.",
   "translation": "优化通常发生在平坦的空间里。"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.08,
   "end": 24.305,
   "text": "But many real problems don't.",
   "translation": "但许多真实问题并非如此。"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.08,
   "end": 34.555,
   "text": "A robot arm, turning in space.",
   "translation": "在空间中转动的机械臂。"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.08,
   "end": 44.355,
   "text": "A drone, closing its loop.",
   "translation": "闭合回环的无人机。"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.08,
   "end": 53.78,
   "text": "Network weights.",
   "translation": "神经网络的权重。"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.08,
   "end": 61.705,
   "text": "Hierarchies.",
   "translation": "层级结构。"
  },
  {
   "start": 66.08,
   "end": 67.73,
   "text": "Brain tissue.",
   "translation": "脑组织。"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.08,
   "end": 73.955,
   "text": "Patterns in data.",
   "translation": "数据中的结构。"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.08,
   "end": 85.58,
   "text": "They all live on manifolds: spaces that curve as a whole, yet look flat up close.",
   "translation": "它们都生活在流形上：整体弯曲、近看却平坦的空间。"
  },
  {
   "start": 92.08,
   "end": 98.73,
   "text": "To optimize there, every familiar idea must be rebuilt: direction, distance, gradient, step.",
   "translation": "要在那里做优化，每个熟悉的概念都必须重建：方向、距离、梯度、步长。"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.08,
   "end": 119.655,
   "text": "This series builds that geometry from the ground up, with full proofs, and pictures that show why every assumption matters.",
   "translation": "这个系列从零开始建立这套几何：完整的证明，以及说明每个假设为何重要的画面。"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.08,
   "end": 135.305,
   "text": "Riemannian Optimization, from the Ground Up.",
   "translation": "从零开始的黎曼优化。"
  }
 ],
